cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analytical study, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "La forma all'ascolto: Solar Ellipse di Barry Truax — Regioni e articolazioni interne in una prospettiva parametrico-estesica"
authors:
  - family-names: Vona
    given-names: Giovanni Maria
abstract: >-
  A parametric-esthesic listening-based analysis of Barry Truax's Solar Ellipse
  (1984–85), proposing four main formal regions and eighteen internal
  articulations based on changes in intensity, pitch/register, timbre,
  density/layering, and temporal development.
keywords:
  - electroacoustic music
  - music analysis
  - Barry Truax
  - Solar Ellipse
  - musical form
  - esthesic analysis
